  "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/smol-machines/smolvm/zipball/v1.37.5",
  "body": "## What's Changed\n* Keep a pack's layers directory reachable by the VM when the pack was built under a strict umask by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/2433\n* Fix three macOS test flakes: open-file exhaustion, a missed socketpair wakeup, and a cargo-only env var by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/2429\n* Let a non-root workload own a folder mounted into a running machine from another filesystem by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/2435\n* Refresh the guest firmware to renew overdue CPU quotas by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/2436\n* Check every path a machine's dropped uid needs before boot, and fix three pre-existing permission bugs it exposed by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/2438\n* Allow live CPU grow and shrink on Linux arm64 by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/2437\n* Fix guest Vulkan on Intel GPUs that do not share the CPU cache by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/2426\n* Prepare SmolVM v1.37.2 for release by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/2439\n* Refresh forwarded ports on Docker container events by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/2444\n* Pin libkrun to 36b08461 for live vCPU resize on Linux arm64 by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/2440\n* Stop a guest thread that outlives its Vulkan instance from crashing on exit by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/2443\n* Keep seed eviction's backing scan from blocking machine creates by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/2445\n* Forward only list and sign to the host SSH agent so a machine cannot add, remove, or lock its keys by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/2441\n* Guard forced machine stops with a host PID by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/2447\n* Keep older-layout pack layers readable under the per-VM uid drop, and repair existing caches by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/2448\n* Report a machine whose image workload failed to launch instead of a plain running start by @BinSquare in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/2449\n* chore(nix): bump flake to 1.37.4 by @github-actions[bot] in https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/pull/2450\n\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/smol-machines/smolvm/compare/v1.37.1...v1.37.5",
